WEBVTT

00:03.060 --> 00:06.720
<i>I always thought I'd never be able
to fall in love,</i>

00:07.180 --> 00:11.310
<i>but now, for the first time in 
my life, I have a boyfriend.</i>

01:43.660 --> 01:49.670
<b>Episode 2</b>

01:43.660 --> 01:49.670
<b>My First Boyfriend</b>

01:51.570 --> 01:53.850
Hananoi-kun! Good morning.

01:54.180 --> 01:56.890
Good morning, Hotaru-chan.

01:57.620 --> 02:01.880
<i>Starting today, I'm his girlfriend.</i>

02:02.700 --> 02:05.970
<i>This is Hananoi-kun from the class next door.</i>

02:05.970 --> 02:10.500
<i>He asked me out the day after we met. 
You could say he's something of an odd duck.</i>

02:11.150 --> 02:14.560
Do you think even I might 
fall in love someday?

02:15.320 --> 02:16.480
I know you will.

02:17.620 --> 02:22.790
<i>With just those few words,
Hananoi-kun gave me so much courage.</i>

02:24.020 --> 02:25.490
Hananoi-kun?

02:26.920 --> 02:28.080
An angel.

02:31.180 --> 02:32.290
An angel?

02:32.290 --> 02:33.560
Oh, sorry.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.750
Did I say that out loud?

02:35.040 --> 02:37.670
<i>He </i>is<i> just a little strange.</i>

02:38.740 --> 02:41.750
It sure got a lot colder today.

02:45.510 --> 02:48.550
Huh? Hotaru-chan, don't you have gloves?

02:49.100 --> 02:51.920
I was running late and forgot them.

02:51.920 --> 02:53.030
Are you okay?

02:53.700 --> 02:55.660
You can use mine if you want.

02:56.660 --> 03:00.270
Thanks! But I run warm anyway,
so I'll be fine.

03:01.270 --> 03:02.480
Okay...

03:02.930 --> 03:05.590
<i>What? Did I say something wrong?</i>

03:05.590 --> 03:06.790
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

03:07.400 --> 03:10.600
You gotta be careful when you're dating.

03:10.600 --> 03:13.820
Don't wanna embarrass your 
boyfriend or anything.

03:14.880 --> 03:16.380
Here. Take this.

03:16.650 --> 03:18.090
I'll let you use it.

03:18.090 --> 03:21.280
Thanks! It's so warm!

03:21.280 --> 03:22.390
<i>I see.</i>

03:22.850 --> 03:27.090
<i>Maybe now that we're dating, 
I can't keep behaving the same way.</i>

03:28.550 --> 03:30.380
And so...

03:30.960 --> 03:33.890
I would like to discuss our 
policies going forward.

03:35.000 --> 03:36.070
Policies?

03:36.590 --> 03:37.640
Huh?

03:37.640 --> 03:40.560
What do you do when you're going out?

03:40.560 --> 03:44.240
Don't you have goals and things
you want to do with a girlfriend?

03:45.150 --> 03:48.880
Uh... I guess so.

03:48.880 --> 03:52.510
I guess eventually getting buried next 
to each other would make me happy.

03:55.600 --> 03:57.990
<i>It's over before it even started.</i>

03:57.990 --> 04:00.380
H-Hananoi-kun, that's not what I mean!

04:00.380 --> 04:03.650
More like, you know, normal kissing 
and hugging, whispering sweet nothings,

04:03.650 --> 04:04.960
and fooling around and stuff!

04:04.960 --> 04:07.650
You want to fool around with me, Hotaru-chan?

04:08.000 --> 04:10.720
<i>Fool... Fool around?</i>

04:11.240 --> 04:16.070
F-Foo... Foola round? Foo la round?

04:11.290 --> 04:13.510
Listen, we don't have to rush things.

04:13.510 --> 04:16.070
You can just be your usual self.

04:16.070 --> 04:19.770
I'm the one who's trying
to get you to you love me.

04:21.970 --> 04:23.740
I'm so tired...

04:25.200 --> 04:28.690
<i>Is it really okay for me to just do nothing?</i>

04:28.690 --> 04:32.960
I never dreamed you two would
actually start dating.

04:33.750 --> 04:36.280
I, for one, still don't accept it!

04:36.280 --> 04:37.220
And you are?

04:37.220 --> 04:41.180
Even if it's just a trial run,
taking my dear Hotaru like this...

04:41.750 --> 04:44.870
I think I'm just letting Hananoi-kun 
spoil me with his love.

04:46.500 --> 04:50.140
I feel like I should be doing my part too.

04:50.720 --> 04:55.210
So I can learn... what 
it feels like to <i>like</i> someone.

04:58.380 --> 05:01.100
So, anyway, what is a girlfriend
 supposed to do?

05:01.100 --> 05:01.780
Oh boy...

05:01.780 --> 05:03.580
You're so naive.

05:03.570 --> 05:06.240
<b>The Next Day</b>

05:05.720 --> 05:07.540
Okay, Hananoi-kun.

05:07.930 --> 05:09.450
See you on the way home.

05:08.740 --> 05:12.050
Um, Hotaru-chan,
I'd like to give you these first.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.300
What are all these notebooks?

05:17.760 --> 05:22.050
Finals are coming up, so I took notes on
 likely questions for each subject yesterday.

05:22.050 --> 05:25.630
For each subject? You mean every single one?
And all in one day?!

05:25.630 --> 05:26.680
I worked hard.

05:28.640 --> 05:31.170
Wow... Thank you.

05:34.440 --> 05:36.690
Um, did you stay up all ni—

05:36.690 --> 05:38.090
Oh, that's the bell.

05:39.020 --> 05:42.050
Homeroom's about to start. See you.

05:42.700 --> 05:44.980
U-Um, wait. Hananoi-kun!

05:47.350 --> 05:50.760
<i>I've gotta do something girlfriendy. 
Something girlfriendy...</i>

05:48.570 --> 05:50.260
<b>"Bye-bye,
darling"?</b>

05:48.570 --> 05:52.160
<b>A kiss?</b>

05:49.890 --> 05:52.160
<b>A hug?</b>

05:50.760 --> 05:52.360
<i>Something girlfriendy!</i>

06:04.030 --> 06:06.820
Bye for now. See you after school.

06:13.370 --> 06:17.480
These notes are incredible. 
They're super easy to understand.

06:17.480 --> 06:21.860
I'm really grateful, but it's starting 
to feel like he's spoiling me <i>too</i> much.

06:22.230 --> 06:25.650
When you like someone,
don't you want to do everything for them?

06:25.650 --> 06:28.600
Yeah, but isn't this kinda overdoing it?

06:29.180 --> 06:31.360
<i>You want to do everything, huh?</i>

06:31.870 --> 06:34.770
<i>It's been like this
 since the hairpin incident.</i>

06:34.770 --> 06:38.530
<i>But he keeps telling me 
I don't need to do anything...</i>

06:39.730 --> 06:41.950
Then I'll give you this.

06:41.950 --> 06:43.420
Here, to pay you back.

06:43.420 --> 06:44.720
Oh, yay!

06:44.720 --> 06:45.590
What are your favorites?

06:45.590 --> 06:48.080
I'm just taking.

06:48.080 --> 06:52.590
It's only a trial, but shouldn't
 both people be having fun

06:53.210 --> 06:56.130
when you're going out together?

07:02.350 --> 07:05.560
You'll be fine! You've got what it takes.

07:05.560 --> 07:07.830
Yeah, I don't think we need to worry.

07:07.830 --> 07:10.290
Sorry I'm such an amateur at love.

07:10.290 --> 07:13.620
But I still can't figure out 
what I'm supposed to do.

07:14.080 --> 07:16.060
If you want to do more than just receive,

07:16.060 --> 07:19.860
why not try doing some of the same things for Hananoi-san that he's done for you?

07:24.230 --> 07:25.750
<i>Of course...</i>

07:27.210 --> 07:28.340
See you later!

07:29.450 --> 07:32.850
<i>I left half an hour early,
which should be plenty of time.</i>

07:33.130 --> 07:34.810
<i>When I thought about it,</i>

07:34.810 --> 07:37.900
<i>I realized that Hananoi-kun
is always waiting for me.</i>

07:38.250 --> 07:41.150
<i>I wonder if he'll be surprised
to find me waiting for him.</i>

07:42.170 --> 07:45.140
<i>I can't make nice study guides for him,</i>

07:45.140 --> 07:47.370
<i>but this is something I </i>can<i> do!</i>

07:47.370 --> 07:49.190
Oh? Hotaru-chan?

07:49.930 --> 07:52.660
Good morning. You sure are early today.

07:52.660 --> 07:56.160
<i>This is harder than I thought!</i>

07:56.160 --> 07:59.040
<b>The Second Morning</b>

07:58.340 --> 08:00.080
<i>Forty-five minutes early...</i>

08:00.430 --> 08:02.710
<i>I'll definitely get there first today.</i>

08:03.410 --> 08:05.490
Good morning, Hotaru-chan.

08:07.210 --> 08:09.710
<b>The Third Morning</b>

08:08.410 --> 08:10.710
<i>M-Maybe if I'm an hour early.</i>

08:11.060 --> 08:12.400
<i>This time for sure!</i>

08:13.190 --> 08:15.220
Good morning, Hotaru-chan.

08:15.660 --> 08:19.710
H-Hananoi-kun, how long
 have you been waiting?

08:20.020 --> 08:21.490
I just got here.

08:24.900 --> 08:26.550
<i>You big liar.</i>

08:27.250 --> 08:30.480
If you keep coming out
 to wait in the cold, you'll get sick!

08:31.870 --> 08:36.000
But I want to spend every 
second I can with you.

08:36.000 --> 08:39.090
E-Every second?

08:40.090 --> 08:45.710
<i>I'm sorry, but I still don't understand 
what that feels like yet.</i>

08:47.390 --> 08:48.990
<i>Is this okay?</i>

08:49.560 --> 08:55.230
<i>Am I really going to be able 
to fall in love like this?</i>

08:55.720 --> 08:57.890
<b>The Fourth Morning</b>

08:56.740 --> 08:58.520
<i>Two hours early!</i>

08:59.320 --> 09:02.640
<i>At this point, I'm just being stubborn, but...</i>

09:02.640 --> 09:03.530
<i>Let's see!</i>

09:05.050 --> 09:07.880
<i>All right! I win!</i>

09:09.660 --> 09:14.260
<i>Hananoi-kun always sits here reading 
a book while he waits for me.</i>

09:18.600 --> 09:20.050
It's so quiet.

09:22.030 --> 09:24.910
<i>I wonder how he'll react
when he finds me waiting for him.</i>

09:25.600 --> 09:28.910
<i>He was so insistent on getting here 
first, I wonder if he'll be angry.</i>

09:29.190 --> 09:30.720
Hotaru-chan!

09:30.720 --> 09:33.430
<i>I wonder what he's like when he's mad...</i>

09:34.400 --> 09:37.440
<i>Or will he be surprised? Will he be happy?</i>

09:38.700 --> 09:41.810
<i>Will he get here soon?</i>

09:42.190 --> 09:44.550
<i>Oh, did I just...</i>

09:46.200 --> 09:47.360
Hotaru-chan?

09:47.670 --> 09:49.880
Hananoi-kun! Good morning!

09:49.880 --> 09:51.970
<i>He's here a lot sooner than I expected!</i>

09:52.860 --> 09:55.490
What are you doing here so early?

09:55.930 --> 10:00.070
Um, I wanted to do something g-girlfriendy,

10:00.070 --> 10:03.760
so I thought it might be nice 
to wait for you for a change.

10:04.330 --> 10:08.000
I didn't realize you got here
 <i>this</i> early every day.

10:08.690 --> 10:10.220
A-Are you mad at me?

10:10.220 --> 10:11.700
No, of course not.

10:12.170 --> 10:16.040
I'm just surprised. Nobody's 
ever waited for me before.

10:18.870 --> 10:20.570
Um, listen.

10:20.570 --> 10:25.310
While I was waiting, I got all 
excited imagining how you'd react.

10:26.130 --> 10:28.510
Waiting for someone is lots of fun!

10:33.120 --> 10:35.830
You were thinking about me
 while you waited?

10:38.530 --> 10:40.140
I see...

10:40.850 --> 10:42.700
<i>He looks overjoyed.</i>

10:44.040 --> 10:48.120
<i>I did something that made 
someone really happy...</i>

10:48.480 --> 10:52.450
<i>I've never done that before. 
It kind of makes me happy too.</i>

10:54.040 --> 10:55.470
<i>I'm so thrilled.</i>

10:56.530 --> 11:01.040
<i>I think I understand how it feels
to be a girlfriend a little bit now.</i>

11:02.090 --> 11:04.290
Hotaru-chan, are you okay?

11:04.290 --> 11:07.190
I'm so sorry. I made you 
wait out here in the col—

11:10.490 --> 11:12.730
See? It makes you worry, right?

11:12.730 --> 11:15.390
Waiting for two hours is just too long.

11:16.630 --> 11:18.330
Wanna hit the corner store to warm up?

11:18.330 --> 11:19.260
Yeah.

11:19.260 --> 11:25.610
<i>Hananoi-kun, I want to see 
you happy a lot more.</i>

11:30.070 --> 11:31.240
Hotaru-chan?

11:32.380 --> 11:33.500
What are you writing?

11:34.050 --> 11:35.810
I had a great idea.

11:37.500 --> 11:41.130
Things We Want to Do

11:37.750 --> 11:39.620
"Things we want to do"?

11:39.620 --> 11:41.140
I just bought it.

11:42.140 --> 11:47.900
What would you say to writing down things
we want to do together in this notebook?

11:48.710 --> 11:53.120
Then we can make good on them in turns.

11:53.120 --> 11:56.370
Slowly, like beginners.
We'll start with the easy things.

11:57.520 --> 12:00.360
<i>I want to get croquettes at the butcher shop by the station after school with you</i>

12:03.380 --> 12:06.240
<i>Let's find more foods we both like</i>

12:06.490 --> 12:08.200
What do you think?

12:08.200 --> 12:09.990
This'll be a piece of cake.

12:11.280 --> 12:13.730
You should write one right now too.

12:25.210 --> 12:27.030
Is that all you want?

12:28.630 --> 12:31.280
You sure don't ask for much.

12:31.280 --> 12:32.790
Piece of cake!

12:39.820 --> 12:41.570
I want

12:44.410 --> 12:46.160
to hold hands

12:47.780 --> 12:49.540
while walking

12:51.360 --> 12:55.380
<i>That day, when I took Hananoi-kun's 
hand for the first time,</i>

12:55.830 --> 12:58.920
<i>it was a little cold and bigger than mine.</i>

12:59.850 --> 13:01.970
<i>I was holding a boy's hand.</i>

13:12.400 --> 13:13.690
<i>I want...</i>

13:13.680 --> 13:15.440
Things We Want to Do

13:14.940 --> 13:16.610
<i>a lot more than you realize.</i>

13:17.190 --> 13:20.020
I want to make you mine alone

13:20.510 --> 13:24.880
<i>It's already been three weeks
since Hananoi-kun and I started temporarily</i>

13:23.650 --> 13:26.530
I want to get croquettes at the butcher shop by the station
 after school with you

13:24.880 --> 13:26.530
<i>quote, unquote "dating."</i>

13:27.020 --> 13:28.540
Let's eat!

13:30.950 --> 13:32.690
<i>Day by day,</i>

13:33.590 --> 13:35.200
<i>just a little at a time,</i>

13:35.200 --> 13:38.470
<i>spending time with him is starting 
to feel more and more natural.</i>

13:39.000 --> 13:41.480
<i>I braced myself at first,</i>

13:41.480 --> 13:44.970
<i>thinking we might do the things 
lovers do since we're going out.</i>

13:44.970 --> 13:48.470
I want to spend Christmas Eve with you

13:45.360 --> 13:49.180
<i>But Hananoi-kun's requests 
are always very gentle.</i>

13:49.600 --> 13:55.240
<i>I thought things might just continue
 to pass this quiet, peaceful way</i>

13:55.240 --> 13:59.850
<i>until we reached our Christmas 
expiration date. And yet...</i>

14:00.210 --> 14:02.370
Here, Hotaru. Your present.

14:02.370 --> 14:03.730
Wow!

14:03.730 --> 14:05.660
Since I can't see you on Christmas Eve.

14:05.660 --> 14:06.920
Thank you!

14:06.920 --> 14:10.850
By the way, isn't your time 
with Hananoi-kun up on Christmas?

14:10.850 --> 14:11.640
Yeah.

14:11.990 --> 14:15.870
See you

14:11.990 --> 14:15.870
Have a great year!

14:12.480 --> 14:15.880
Only three more days...
It sure went by fast.

14:15.880 --> 14:18.720
So, how's it actually been thus far?

14:18.720 --> 14:20.620
He's a really sweet, nice guy.

14:20.620 --> 14:24.510
It's relaxing being with him, 
even when time passes slowly.

14:24.510 --> 14:27.800
I'm honestly a little sad 
it'll all be over in three days.

14:27.080 --> 14:28.400
Th-Then...

14:28.400 --> 14:32.430
But I'm still not sure if the way 
I like him is something like love.

14:32.940 --> 14:34.910
The other day, I ended up saying to him,

14:34.910 --> 14:39.990
"If I stay like this and can't fall in love, 
I still want to be friends with you."

14:40.330 --> 14:41.310
No way.

14:42.270 --> 14:44.040
That's what he said in turn.

14:44.040 --> 14:45.840
So you still aren't committed.

14:47.770 --> 14:49.670
It's just really difficult for me.

14:49.670 --> 14:51.180
The answer is simple!

14:51.750 --> 14:53.550
You should try kissing him.

14:53.780 --> 14:56.130
Huh?! Kei-chan?!

14:55.790 --> 15:00.420
This is Kyo-chan's boyfriend, Keigo-kun

14:56.130 --> 15:00.410
If someone you don't like gets close, 
you pull back. Like you did just now.

15:00.770 --> 15:05.320
Even I do it. Before Hibiki and I
started dating, when she stole a kiss...

15:08.660 --> 15:11.670
Sorry, but could you forget 
you ever heard that?

15:12.970 --> 15:17.920
Anyway, Hananoi is a good dude, huh?
Not at all how I imagined him.

15:17.920 --> 15:18.680
Huh?

15:19.130 --> 15:23.250
He's real prickly in class. 
Just be careful, Hinase-san.

15:23.250 --> 15:25.930
You seem pretty straitlaced, y'know?

15:25.930 --> 15:29.560
The guys in my class totally think he's 
just taking advantage of—

15:29.560 --> 15:30.950
Kei-chan-san!

15:30.950 --> 15:34.600
I'm sorry! He's being so rude.

15:34.600 --> 15:36.240
I-It's okay.

15:36.480 --> 15:41.530
But to be honest, I find Hananoi-kun 
kinda hard to read too.

15:41.530 --> 15:45.200
Still, he's got good taste if he chose you.

15:45.200 --> 15:48.690
Anyway, no matter how things 
turn out, I'm on your side.

15:48.690 --> 15:50.880
Yeah, I appreciate it.

16:03.230 --> 16:05.840
Oh? Hananoi-kun?

16:07.230 --> 16:10.110
I told you to head home without me today.

16:10.110 --> 16:10.970
I know.

16:10.970 --> 16:15.970
But it's the last day of class and I wanted
 to spend a little more time with you.

16:15.970 --> 16:18.610
Okay. If you'd told me sooner...

16:19.220 --> 16:22.620
You said you would start waiting 
for me somewhere warm, right?

16:22.620 --> 16:23.730
Sorry.

16:23.730 --> 16:25.420
Want to hit the corner store again?

16:25.420 --> 16:26.760
Hey, see those two?

16:27.100 --> 16:31.020
Yeah. Hananoi-kun's girlfriend 
looks so boring. What a shocker.

16:31.020 --> 16:33.750
If I was her, I wouldn't have
had the guts to say yes to him.

16:38.340 --> 16:40.430
None of them get it.

16:41.240 --> 16:44.230
They don't know how much I admire you.

16:46.160 --> 16:47.480
Admire?

16:48.610 --> 16:52.260
Say, we can't hang out
at the corner store for that long.

16:52.260 --> 16:53.400
Wanna go to my place?

16:53.400 --> 16:54.990
You mean your house?

16:55.250 --> 16:58.260
Yeah. I want to talk to you 
about Christmas and stuff.

16:58.260 --> 16:59.340
Okay.

17:00.620 --> 17:02.870
Don't mind me...

17:07.400 --> 17:08.610
Wow!

17:09.340 --> 17:11.920
It looks just like I pictured 
your place would be!

17:12.840 --> 17:15.990
Are your parents at work right now?

17:15.990 --> 17:21.120
Yeah. They go overseas a lot,
so they aren't usually home.

17:22.200 --> 17:24.070
What do they do?

17:24.070 --> 17:25.690
They're both doctors.

17:25.690 --> 17:26.970
Whoa.

17:27.280 --> 17:31.500
Wait, does that mean you're 
always home alone?

17:31.980 --> 17:35.070
My grandmother comes
to check on me on the weekends.

17:35.470 --> 17:36.610
I see.

17:36.610 --> 17:40.620
Ah, sorry. There's no food 
in the house right now.

17:40.850 --> 17:42.120
Want to order sushi?

17:42.430 --> 17:43.870
I can't do that!

17:44.170 --> 17:47.320
Is it normal to order sushi all the time?

17:47.320 --> 17:50.920
I guess I'm just getting
 carried away since you're here.

17:52.110 --> 17:54.890
Um, are you okay, Hananoi-kun?

17:55.320 --> 17:57.860
Your face is all red even 
though we're inside now.

17:58.290 --> 18:03.250
I'm totally fine. I'll make some tea, 
so why don't you wait in my room?

18:07.070 --> 18:11.050
<i>Wow! So this what Hananoi-kun's 
room is like.</i>

18:11.900 --> 18:14.060
<i>He has a ton of books.</i>

18:14.590 --> 18:17.320
Kinda reminds me of my grandpa's house.

18:17.320 --> 18:19.430
These all look really difficult.

18:21.760 --> 18:24.250
This is the only shelf with a curtain.

18:33.440 --> 18:34.530
Don't open that.

18:35.690 --> 18:38.590
I-I'm sorry! I wasn't actually going to peek.

18:39.500 --> 18:41.680
It's my Hotaru-chan shrine.

18:42.630 --> 18:45.410
If you want to peek, you'd best be prepared.

18:45.410 --> 18:50.650
<i>He's got a shrine for me? N-Now I'm dying
 to know what's behind that curtain.</i>

18:50.650 --> 18:52.440
<i>But I'm too scared to look!</i>

18:54.330 --> 18:56.300
I-I think I'm good.

18:56.300 --> 18:57.030
Okay.

19:00.050 --> 19:03.630
You know, you're kind of a mystery,
 Hananoi-kun.

19:03.630 --> 19:04.960
You just noticed?

19:05.320 --> 19:08.020
You're pretty unusual yourself, Hotaru-chan.

19:08.020 --> 19:12.590
Am I? My family always tells 
me that I'm way too normal.

19:12.590 --> 19:16.210
Well, most normal folks stay away
from people they find strange.

19:16.470 --> 19:20.150
Plus, when someone's alone 
with a guy in his room,

19:20.150 --> 19:22.560
they'd keep their guard up
since he might try something.

19:22.560 --> 19:25.980
Y-You mean something lovey-dovey?

19:25.980 --> 19:28.000
Yeah, yeah. Something lovey-dovey.

19:29.820 --> 19:33.280
I can't imagine anyone wanting 
to do anything like that to me.

19:33.510 --> 19:37.970
When I hear my friends talking about it, 
it just sounds so alien to me.

19:35.660 --> 19:38.140
Our first kiss was in the gym.

19:38.140 --> 19:38.860
Can it!

19:39.090 --> 19:41.290
You'd say that with me right here?

19:41.680 --> 19:43.030
Ah, sorry.

19:44.020 --> 19:48.960
I guess to you,
I'm still not a boyfriend yet.

19:49.670 --> 19:52.260
U-Um, that's not what I meant.

19:52.260 --> 19:56.570
It's fine. We're doing this trial 
to figure that out, after all.

19:57.120 --> 20:02.800
But you know, I said this before, but I 
have no intention of becoming your friend.

20:03.220 --> 20:07.390
To me, that would feel like being 
one random member of a big crowd.

20:07.790 --> 20:10.600
I want to be someone special to you.

20:10.600 --> 20:12.810
A-And if you can't be?

20:13.610 --> 20:17.070
If I can't, then you'll never see me again.

20:25.450 --> 20:27.770
Say, I have an idea.

20:28.510 --> 20:31.580
Would you mind trying to kiss me once?

20:34.210 --> 20:35.240
Are you okay?

20:35.550 --> 20:40.700
Er, of course I don't mean actually kissing.
Just holding our faces close together.

20:41.750 --> 20:45.200
My friend's boyfriend told me
 if you do that, you'll know

20:45.200 --> 20:47.860
whether you really like someone or not.

20:48.540 --> 20:52.280
Holding hands and hugging are 
things you do even with friends,

20:52.280 --> 20:57.260
but with a kiss, I think I'd 
know if it didn't feel right. So...

20:57.260 --> 20:58.140
Okay.

20:58.660 --> 21:00.580
Let's try kissing.

21:00.580 --> 21:04.350
Thank you! I'm sorry to ask
 something so weird.

21:04.350 --> 21:07.340
And if you don't like it, 
we can stop right away.

21:07.340 --> 21:07.870
Hotaru-chan.

21:09.640 --> 21:11.040
Close your eyes.

21:14.200 --> 21:15.200
Okay.

21:16.710 --> 21:19.790
<i>Wait, the mood feels totally different now.</i>

21:20.780 --> 21:23.790
<i>Not being able to see is making me nervous.</i>

21:32.060 --> 21:35.850
You shouldn't let someone do this if 
you aren't even sure you like them.

21:46.280 --> 21:51.130
It may not mean anything to you,

21:51.730 --> 21:53.340
but it's different for me.

21:54.640 --> 21:58.350
Even holding your hand, 
even just touching you...

21:59.380 --> 22:01.750
makes my heart ache so badly.
